Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ZoneRebalance: six sketch corrections (gate 75 minors
 1-4), docstrings only

zr_leftWalk_fields (the scratch step first, the walk over the ruler's tail),
zr_finalContract (the final seek's displacement), exists_zoneExtendTM's
implementation note (the right seek's endpoint), zr_hmSc1 and zr_hmSc2 (the
writes are mapped single-cell copies), zr_fpSeg_time (the escape round and the
per-round control steps). The code is identical with comments stripped.

